1
00:00:03,766 --> 00:00:06,133
Finish your painting first, then we'll meet up.

2
00:00:19,966 --> 00:00:22,066
Ah Tan, tomorrow at 3 PM at Rongwan Coast. Let's meet again.

3
00:00:24,766 --> 00:00:26,466
Okay. Tomorrow at 3 PM, I'll be waiting for you.

4
00:00:28,366 --> 00:00:30,600
Nawin, I finally get to see you.

5
00:00:32,733 --> 00:00:35,833
You didn't send a driver, and no one's waiting for me at the studio, right?

6
00:00:36,433 --> 00:00:38,133
No, I came alone.

7
00:00:40,033 --> 00:00:42,633
If I don't show up again one day, will you still be scared?

8
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:47,700
I would be. But I can ask you now, instead of blocking your door.

9
00:00:48,333 --> 00:00:50,266
Let's start over then, my boyfriend, Thanat.

10
00:00:53,033 --> 00:00:55,300
Hello there, my boyfriend, Nawin.

11
00:00:57,666 --> 00:00:59,900
If only you hadn't been so awful at the beginning.

12
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:04,733
I ruined our beginning. From now on, I'll listen to you first.

13
00:01:05,933 --> 00:01:08,066
Can I kiss you now?

14
00:01:27,033 --> 00:01:28,866
Let's go. I'll walk with you, nice and slow.

15
00:01:30,900 --> 00:01:33,133
My studio is just up ahead. You still want to come along, don't you?

16
00:01:33,933 --> 00:01:34,066
Yeah.

17
00:01:34,566 --> 00:01:35,266
Can I come back with you?

18
00:01:35,666 --> 00:01:36,666
Yeah. Come with me.
